From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Prithwiraj Samanta <app@datainsights.ae>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:16:47 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] telecode: several canvas documents per project

A TeleDesign project now holds docs/<doc>.fig documents with a default.
?doc=<id> picks the document (absent = the default); the storage binding is
<project>/<doc>, the bridge socket reports which document the page has open,
td-editor:open takes {pid, doc} and td-editor:ready/saved carry doc_id.
telecode_doc_open reloads the page on another document; telecode_doc_list /
telecode_doc_create are answered by the proxy.
